        "Title": "Sheik-ing Things Up",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111283229353",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have received a cry for help from one of our rival contract agencies. They had been contracted by the wealthy and powerful al-Ghazali family to infiltrate the Kronstadt Innovation Race in Miami and eliminate three targets. While they have not given us the specifics of the contract beyond this, they have told us that their operative is in attendance, impersonating Sheikh Sulman al-Ghazali -- however, he has failed to deliver. To avoid the al-Ghazalis finding out, you&apos;ll need to take over.",
